## Goal
A PCA of the samples from the gene counts, coloured by condition: show how the six rnaseq_bulk
samples (A1-A3 untreated, B1-B3 treated) position relative to each other on the leading
principal components of gene expression, with each sample's point coloured by its `condition`
from the design table.

## Inputs
Artifact types resolve through each sub-stage's OUTPUTS.tsv at execution time; the paths
