## Execution
Runs: batch
Submitted through the workspace's configured executor (Slurm) via `_system/executorlib.py submit`.
Expected wall time under 2 minutes on a single CPU with a few GB of memory: six samples,
~200 genes. Expected output size under 2 MB in total.
